/*
 * Declares the ContinueValue class.
 *
 * ContinueValue represents a `continue` instruction in the generator IR. A
 * continue stops the current iteration of the nearest enclosing loop construct,
 * and continue to the next one.
 *
 * Although continue statements participate in control-flow management, they are
 * not scope-introducing constructs. They are therefore grouped in the same
 * module as other scope-related generator values for organizational coherence.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::scope::continue_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/scope/continue_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2021-11-20
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
